Source: wq9201s-wifi-bt-dkms
Section: contrib/kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Seeed Studio <techsupport@seeed.cc>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>=11~), dkms (<< 3.0.3-3~) | dh-sequence-dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2.1

Package: wq9201s-wifi-bt-dkms
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: dkms (>= 1.95), ${misc:Depends}
Description: WQ9201S WiFi+BT combo driver (DKMS) with firmware
 SDIO WiFi driver source for the WQ9201S combo module, compiled by DKMS
 at install time against the running kernel (no prebuilt .ko).
 .
 Ships the full firmware set (wifi/dtop/bt/oem/phy), wq_wlan_settings.ini
 (fw_sys=5, required for BT firmware download), the wq9201s-bt systemd
 service for H4 BT attach, and modprobe blacklists for the legacy
 AIC8800 driver.
 .
 Kernel headers are required to compile the module.
